# Security headers (L-1) — dilayani Cloudflare untuk semua path.
# Catatan CSP: 'unsafe-inline' pada script/style WAJIB — index.html punya inline
# theme-init script + komponen pakai inline style (motion/Tailwind/LCP placeholder).
# XSS utama sudah ditutup di layer lain (markdown sanitize + React auto-escape).
# CSP di sini = defense-in-depth: kunci connect-src, frame-ancestors, object-src, base-uri.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(self)
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com data:; img-src 'self' data: blob:; connect-src 'self' https://*.supabase.co; worker-src 'self'; manifest-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
